{%- comment -%}
  SafePet Strap™ — High-Converting Loox-Style Photo Reviews Section
  ================================================================
  Engineered for maximum conversion rate lift on Dog Car Safety Straps:
  - 4.9/5 Aggregate Rating Summary Bar with Star Breakdown
  - "Verified Dog Parent" Trust Badges
  - Customer UGC Photo Strip / Carousel with Lightbox Zoom
  - Interactive Filter Tabs (All, With Photos, 5 Stars)
  - Masonry Loox-style Review Cards with Customer Photos, Dog Breed, Car Model
  - Helpful Vote Counters
  - Interactive "Write a Review" Modal Dialog
  - Zero external bloat (100% native Liquid, Vanilla JS & pure CSS, 0 console errors)
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="safepet-loox-section" id="safepetLooxReviews-{{ section.id }}" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
